<h2 id="annex--guidance-notes">8. Annex – Guidance notes</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Please provide details of your organisation’s baseline emissions. If your organisation has not previously assessed or reported emissions, please state this and use your first reporting period as your baseline.</li>
